	(text "RELAY COIL DRIVER - INTERNAL REV B, NOT FOR PRODUCTION\n24V relay coil only, assigned maximum100mA; not a direct load or motor PWM key.\nQ203 IRF640PbF 200V: G=1 D=2 S=3, metal tab=D; do not ground tab.\nVishay91036 Rev.D09-Dec-2024; Rds<=0.18ohm atVgs10V/Tj25C, not a hot guarantee.\nInternal coil interface J201.1=24V,J201.2=switched negative. Not an external relay module.\nD202 cathode=coil positive, anode=drain. Copy channels independently for FUEL/SAFETY.\n2x drain rating requires Vdspeak<=100V INCLUDING diode and wiring; protection still open.\n10..14V gate drive target, OFF/transients/temperature and release time remain unqualified.\nKeep D202 at socket coil pins; diode clamp slows release. No fuel/fire tests permitted.\nSocket/contact selection and root/PCB integration remain incomplete."
	(at 145 185 0)
